    "rules": [
      "Use one semantic color per branch; do not encode unrelated meanings with the same hue.",
      "Keep real evidence thumbnails inside the panel that names their provenance.",
      "Route all cross-tier edges as elbow connectors with visible junction dots.",
      "Reserve the dark convergence bar for a single shared artifact or decision.",
      "Keep logos and icons native vector assets; generated imagery is background/evidence only.",
